This project is a modified version of the "productivity" plugin from
Anthropic's knowledge-work-plugins repository
(https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins), which is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. The original work is copyright Anthropic.

Changes from the original:
- skills/dashboard.html: added [start → end] date ranges on tasks, deadline /
  manual sorting, the timeline view (category swimlanes, process
  roll-up bars with completion %, drag-to-move and resize bars, milestone
  diamonds from dated sub-items, public holidays and vacation bands, deadline
  column, row hover across columns, status filters, overdue counter, day /
  week / month zoom), recurring-task markers ([↻ cadence]) that create the next
  instance on completion, source links on tasks, an English/French interface,
  a token-based dark/light theme, an unsupported-browser message, and a
  demo mode (?demo) with generated example tasks.
- skills/*/SKILL.md: rewritten around date-ranged tasks, a weekly update
  routine (snapshot diff, 90-day archive, recurring top-up, review-first
  suggestions, dismissed-suggestion list) and connector-agnostic sources.
- index.html, template/ and prompts/: new.

